{"seq":2,"slug":"edge-node-failure-autonomy","title":"边缘节点故障自治与断连韧性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-operations-and-resilience/edge-node-failure-autonomy","wordCount":3124,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘节点故障自治与断连韧性\">边缘节点故障自治与断连韧性</h1><p>跨境电商的边缘节点天然工作在不可靠环境里：东南亚商场里的取货柜 PoP 会因市电波动重启，跨境专线会在海缆维护窗口抖动，大促时源站侧控制面未必有带宽持续下发指令。若每次状态变更都要等中心批准、每次写操作都要等回源确认，上游一断，边缘就从「就近算力」退化成一块砖。本文讨论：当边缘节点与中心失去连接、或自身部分组件失效时，它如何靠本地权威继续提供有限但正确的服务，并在恢复后把分歧收敛回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要把「自治」和「韧性」拆开看。**自治（autonomy）**指节点在失去上游连接后仍能独立决策并执行的那部分能力；**韧性（resilience）**指系统在故障后维持可接受服务水平、并在恢复后回到一致状态的能力。设某操作在断连条件下的成功率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{op}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，本地自治覆盖了操作集的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 比例，节点在线率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{op} \\approx u \\cdot 1 + (1-u) \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子给出一个反直觉结论：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 从 99.9% 提到 99.99% 只改善十万分之一，而把自治覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0.2 提到 0.8，在 1% 断连时间里就带来 0.6 个百分点的净收益。边缘运维的投入应优先压在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 上——链路越偏远廉价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 越难保证，越需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 兜底。</p>\n<p>故障不是单一事件，而是一组分层的失效模式，每层对应不同的自治手段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F[边缘节点失效事件] --&gt; L1[上行链路断连]&#10;    F --&gt; L2[中心控制面不可达]&#10;    F --&gt; L3[节点局部组件崩溃]&#10;    F --&gt; L4[整机掉电或硬件损毁]&#10;    L1 --&gt; A1[继续本地调度 + 缓存回源]&#10;    L2 --&gt; A1&#10;    L3 --&gt; A2[本地守护进程拉起&lt;br/&gt;systemd 重启]&#10;    L4 --&gt; A3[邻节点接管&lt;br/&gt;流量重路由 + 状态重建]&#10;    A1 --&gt; R[恢复后对账收敛]&#10;    A2 --&gt; R&#10;    A3 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    F[边缘节点失效事件] --&gt; L1[上行链路断连]\n    F --&gt; L2[中心控制面不可达]\n    F --&gt; L3[节点局部组件崩溃]\n    F --&gt; L4[整机掉电或硬件损毁]\n    L1 --&gt; A1[继续本地调度 + 缓存回源]\n    L2 --&gt; A1\n    L3 --&gt; A2[本地守护进程拉起&lt;br/&gt;systemd 重启]\n    L4 --&gt; A3[邻节点接管&lt;br/&gt;流量重路由 + 状态重建]\n    A1 --&gt; R[恢复后对账收敛]\n    A2 --&gt; R\n    A3 --&gt; R</pre><p>不同失效层对「谁还能做决定」的影响截然不同：链路断连只影响通信不影响本地算力；控制面不可达冻结「新指令」但已有本地状态仍有效；整机损毁则连本地状态都没了。一张故障分类表是自治设计的第一步：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效层</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>本地权威是否可用</th>\n<th>主要自治手段</th>\n<th>恢复动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上行断连</td>\n<td>专线抖动、海缆维护</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n<td>继续本地调度，请求排队/降级</td>\n<td>重传积压请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制面不可达</td>\n<td>云端 API 过载、跨区故障</td>\n<td>可用（旧配置）</td>\n<td>本地控制器维持期望态</td>\n<td>拉取最新期望态并 diff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部组件崩溃</td>\n<td>kubelet/OOM、磁盘写满</td>\n<td>部分可用</td>\n<td>守护进程重启 + 健康探针</td>\n<td>组件自愈后重新注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整机损毁</td>\n<td>掉电、硬件故障</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>邻节点接管、流量重路由</td>\n<td>从副本重建本地状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"断连检测与租约语义\">断连检测与租约语义</h2><p>自治的起点是「先判断已经断连」，判错有两种代价：把抖动误判为断连会频繁切自治、状态反复 reconcile；把真断连误判为在线则请求一直阻塞在等中心响应上。Kubernetes 节点体系的核心机制是 <strong>lease（租约）+ 心跳</strong>：kubelet 周期续约一个 <code>Lease</code> 对象（默认每 10 秒），节点控制器若超过 <code>nodeMonitorGracePeriod</code>（默认 40 秒）未见续约就把节点标为 <code>NotReady</code>；两个值由 <code>kube-controller-manager</code> 的 <code>--node-monitor-period</code> 与 <code>--node-monitor-grace-period</code> 调整（来源：kubernetes.io/docs/reference/node/node-status/）。租约比单纯心跳多了一层时间语义：<strong>过期即失效，无需等对方明确告知。</strong></p>\n<p>检测时延直接决定业务可容忍的断连窗口。设心跳间隔为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、判定阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次丢失，最坏检测时延 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{detect} \\approx (k+1) \\cdot h + T_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h=10\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 40 秒。对 POS 收银这类交互操作，「假在线」不可接受——用户会卡在等待里。因此边缘必须把「与中心的连接状态」和「本地能否处理请求」解耦：本地请求路径永不阻塞在中心往返上，中心不可达只关闭需要中心配合的功能（如实时库存扣减），可离线完成的功能（本地校验、落单排队）继续放行。</p>\n<p>SuperEdge 用<strong>分布式节点健康检查</strong>取代单点上报，让相邻边缘节点互相探测，把健康裁决下放到边缘侧（来源：github.com/superedge/superedge）；KubeEdge 的 <code>edgehub</code> 与云端 <code>cloudhub</code> 用 WebSocket 长连接通信，断连后节点上的 <code>edged</code> 继续依据本地缓存的工作负载描述运行（来源：kubeedge.io）。检测要防两类不对称错误：<strong>误报</strong>（在线判为断连）触发无谓的自治切换与对账、放大控制面负载；<strong>漏报</strong>（断连判为在线）导致请求阻塞、超时级联。生产上用「多信号取与」降误报：链路层 <strong>且</strong> 应用层探活 <strong>且</strong> 时间窗内无中心下行消息，才判定断连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自治运行与本地控制回路\">自治运行与本地控制回路</h2><p>一旦判定断连，边缘节点需从「受控模式」切到「自治模式」，核心是本地存在一条不依赖中心的控制回路。Kubernetes 已为自治留了空间：kubelet 缓存 Pod 的期望状态（<code>podSpec</code>），即使 API Server 不可达容器也继续运行，只有重新调度、拉新镜像、读 ConfigMap/Secret 变更时才受阻；KubeEdge 的 edged 组件强化了这一点——为断连场景保留本地元数据存储，使节点离线期间维持既有工作负载的期望态（来源同上）。</p>\n<p>自治模式的决策边界可形式化为一个本地策略函数。设本地可用资源为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{local}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、待处理队列长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、降级等级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\in \\{0,1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span>