</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">充足</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或资源紧张</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或关键组件不可用</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分级降级的价值在于<strong>保住最有价值的流量</strong>。对跨境电商边缘节点，优先级通常是：身份/风控校验 &gt; 下单落库（可排队）&gt; 库存查询（可返回本地快照 + 陈旧标记）&gt; 推荐/个性化 &gt; 日志上报与埋点。断连期主动砍掉埋点和推荐、把配额留给交易主链路，是<strong>主动降级优于被动熔断</strong>的体现。</p>\n<p>本地控制回路的最小闭环由三部分组成：<strong>本地守护进程</strong>（systemd 或 supervisord）把崩溃组件拉起——这属于「局部失效」层，靠守护 + 探针自愈，不需上报中心；<strong>本地期望态缓存</strong>保存最近同步的策略、路由表、证书有效期，自治期行为必须由它决定而非硬编码；<strong>本地队列与状态存储</strong>承接写操作，落盘 + WAL 保证进程重启不丢数据。这里有一条容易踩的坑：<strong>自治期配置必须自带过期语义</strong>。若节点带永不过期的路由/证书/限额缓存离线运行数月，复连后可能已越过安全或合规边界；可行做法是给本地缓存标注 <code>valid_until</code>，超期即把降级等级强制推到 2，只保留最保底能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断连期写入的排队-幂等与对账\">断连期写入的排队、幂等与对账</h2><p>断连期最棘手的是「写」而非「读」——下单、扣库存、写日志都要最终落到权威源。边缘采用 <strong>store-and-forward（存储转发）</strong>：写请求先落本地持久队列，复连后按序重放，重放须解决<strong>重复</strong>与<strong>冲突</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>重复</strong>由幂等键消除：每个写请求生成时分配一个全局唯一、稳定的 idempotency key（如 <code>order_id</code> 或客户端 UUID），服务端按 key 去重。这与支付网关的幂等接口同义：同一 key 的重复提交只生效一次。没有幂等键的 store-and-forward 会在反复重连时把一笔订单下成三笔。<strong>冲突</strong>按操作类型分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>收敛规则</th>\n<th>电商例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可交换/可合并</td>\n<td>操作可叠加</td>\n<td>CRDT 合并（G-Counter、OR-Set）</td>\n<td>访问计数、埋点累加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最后写入胜</td>\n<td>同一字段被双方覆盖</td>\n<td>LWW（按逻辑时钟择新）</td>\n<td>购物车备注、地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可自动合并</td>\n<td>语义冲突需裁决</td>\n<td>上报中心人工/规则裁决</td>\n<td>库存扣减、优惠券核销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>库存与优惠券属第三类——它们是<strong>不可超卖的负向资源</strong>，边缘侧不能靠 LWW 拍板（两台 PoP 都本地扣成功就超卖）。正确做法是断连期只做<strong>预留（reservation）</strong>：本地记「意图扣减 N」，可用量标「待确认」；复连时把预留提交中心，由中心按权威库存裁决哪些成功——这与分布式事务「预留-确认-补偿」一致，只是把协调点后置到复连时刻。冲突越晚收敛、需回滚的已确认操作越多，因此高价值操作应设断连期上限（如超过 15 分钟的预留转人工复核）。对账还要防「重放放大」：复连瞬间多个节点同时把积压队列倒给中心会把它打垮，对策是<strong>退避式重放</strong>——按节点 ID 做抖动指数退避、分批上行，中心侧具备限流与背压（Kubernetes 客户端的 rate limiter，QPS + Burst，即此模式的通用实现）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"脑裂防护与灰度回归\">脑裂防护与灰度回归</h2><p>比断连更危险的是<strong>脑裂（split-brain）</strong>：分区两侧各自认为自己是权威并同时服务，直接后果是同一笔库存被两侧各自扣减。防护核心是<strong>任何时刻只有一个权威</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>租约 + 任期（fencing token）</strong>：权威方持单调递增的任期号，任何写入都必须带任期号，旧任期写入被拒；Kubernetes 的 leader election 用的就是 <code>Lease</code> + 资源版本比较（来源：kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/architecture/leases/）。</li>\n<li><strong>法定人数（quorum）</strong>：需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2f+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个确认才提交，分区少数派自动停服；代价是节点数不足时无法过半。</li>\n<li><strong>本地约束</strong>：断连期把不可合并操作降级为「预留而非提交」（上一节），从源头避免双侧同时提交。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>边缘的现实是很多 PoP 只有 1-3 个节点，凑不齐 quorum，所以更依赖<strong>租约超时 + 预留语义</strong>而非多数派投票。设计时要明确节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与可容忍失效数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时无容错，只能靠预留与人工兜底。</p>\n<p>节点从断连回归要<strong>灰度</strong>：先只读接入做对账，校正本地状态后才按比例或按业务分片放行可写流量。这把「复连」从瞬时事件变成有明确阶段的可观测过程；若对账清单长期清不空，说明冲突规则有缺陷，需回到上一节补规则。回归中还要处理<strong>证书与凭证时效</strong>：断连期间凭据若过期或被吊销，复连后必须先用最新凭据完成身份校验再同步数据，否则对账通道本身就是隐患——<strong>过期即降级，而不是过期即沉默</strong>，这与「自治缓存必须带 <code>valid_until</code>」是同一条纪律的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{op} \\approx u + (1-u)\\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 判断投入方向：偏远廉价链路上，提升自治覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的回报高于追高在线率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>故障分四层（断连 / 控制面不可达 / 组件崩溃 / 整机损毁），每层对应不同自治手段，不要用一套机制硬套。</li>\n<li>检测用租约语义 + 多信号取与，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{detect} \\approx (k+1)h + T_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；本地请求路径绝不能阻塞在中心往返上。</li>\n<li>自治期维护本地期望态缓存并标注 <code>valid_until</code>，过期即强制降级到最保底能力。</li>\n<li>写操作走 store-and-forward，用幂等键去重；冲突按可合并 / LWW / 不可合并三类处理，库存类负向资源只做预留不做本地提交。</li>\n<li>脑裂用租约任期或 quorum 防护；节点少时优先依赖租约 + 预留语义，而非多数派投票。</li>\n<li>复连走只读接入 → 对账 → 校正 → 灰度放行，把复连做成可观测的阶段性过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>断连期的调度降级决策如何与上层编排器协同，见同 hub 的《<a href=\"../2_near-user-compute-scheduling/2_edge-orchestration-scheduling.md\"></a>边缘编排与调度机制：Kubernetes 下沉与联邦》；回源链路本身的可靠性设计见《<a href=\"../1_edge-platform-architecture/3_edge-network-dataplane-backhaul.md\"></a>边缘网络平面、流量调度与回源互联》。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘节点故障自治与断连韧性","id":"边缘节点故障自治与断连韧性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"断连检测与租约语义","id":"断连检测与租约语义"},{"level":2,"text":"自治运行与本地控制回路","id":"自治运行与本地控制回路"},{"level":2,"text":"断连期写入的排队、幂等与对账","id":"断连期写入的排队-幂等与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"脑裂防护与灰度回归","id":"脑裂防护与灰度回归"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘平台可观测性与分布式遥测体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-operations-and-resilience/edge-observability-telemetry"},"next":{"title":"边缘平台 SLO、成本与合规度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-operations-and-resilience/edge-platform-slo-cost-compliance"}}